                <note rend="inline" type="source">611.6831/63: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Greece</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Laughin</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Athens</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-01-20T13:00:00+02:00"><hi rendition="#italic">January 20,
                                1925—1 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 1:55 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>5. Your 2, January 16, 5 p.m. I confirmed exchange in formal note dated January
                    19th.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Laughlin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
